	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Anno 1551 adi 31. maii <placeName ref="l296">Londini</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>S. P.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Clarissime d. <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, ex nundinis <placeName ref="l157">Franckfordiensibus</placeName> tibi scripsi.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Misi d. <persName ref="p8111">Petro Martyri</persName> primum folium com<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>mentariorum suorum; placet illi forma et litera, mallet tamen maiori forma; admoneas, queso, d. <persName ref="p1227">Froschouerum</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ut maturet aeditionem; valde exoptatur ab omnibus.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Quinta tua Decas ab omnibus piis rapitur.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Vellem, <persName ref="p1227">Froschouerus</persName> librum tuum De origine erroris imprimendum susciperet; expectatur a multis, non saltem <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>hic in <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName>, verum desyderio apud nos et in <placeName ref="l642">Phrysia</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Curavi tuas literas per certos et fideles <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>amicos.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Principi nostro tuas literas et librum tradidi, quem summo desyderio expectaverat;; inquit: "Utinam <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>facultas daretur vicissim gratificandi;" ego autem te non munera, sed constantiam per Christum optare, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>que iam in dies in principe accrescit.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Statui deo volente me velle invisere una cum d. <persName ref="p2639">Valerando Pollano</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>d. <persName ref="p1560">Hoperum</persName> in suo diocoesi; habet enim in manibus Bibliorum partem, quam corrigendam suscepit.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Si Possem [<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>a] regia maiestate impetrare per d. <persName ref="p1560">Hoperum</persName> et d. <persName ref="p674">Cantuariensem</persName> imprimendi privilegium, resarcirem damnum <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>in impressis Bibliis passum; nondum 50 exemplaria vendidi.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Ad hoc impetrandum optarem tuas literas <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>commendititias ad d. <persName ref="p674">Cantuariensem</persName> et d. <persName ref="p1560">Hoperum</persName> vel, si tibi visum fuerit, ad ipsum regem.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Non crederes, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>quo animo literas et doctorum Germanorum suscipit; sine dubio tuis literis mihi concederetur.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>A multis passim hic emitur Biblia <persName>Sebastiani Castalionis</persName>; sed vestra multo diligentius legitur et optatur <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>duabus translationibus emitti.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Ad hanc aeditionem hortandus est <persName ref="p1227">Froschouerus</persName>, etiamsi deponent reliquos <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>prelo submissos.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutat t[uam] d[ominationem] et omnes pios d. <persName ref="p8041">a Lasco</persName> et <persName ref="p8061">Utenhovius</persName> et d. <persName ref="p2639">Valerandus Pollanus</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>non indiligens promotor profugorum.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta, queso, meo nomine d. <persName ref="p8011">Gvalterum</persName>, <persName ref="p1283">Gesnerum</persName>, <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>et quos noveris mihi amicos.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Servet te optimus maximus nobis diu incolumem ad nominis sui gloriam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Tuus e<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>x animo <persName ref="p380">Iohannes Byrckmannus</persName> bibliopola <placeName ref="l267">Coloniensis</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Para, queso, mi d. <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, responsum et mitte literas <lb xml:id="p1z21"/><placeName ref="l491">Argentoratum</placeName> ad nundinas in aedibus <persName ref="p18383">Wendelini Rihelii</persName>; si <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>possum tempestive absolvere hic mea negotia, adero <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>deo annuente.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Henrico <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, domino colendo.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
